language: {{language}}
schema: frontend
context: |
  Project: {{projectName}}
  Project Type: Frontend Application
  Tech Stack: {{techStackName}} - React 18+, TypeScript, Vite
  Testing: Vitest + React Testing Library + Playwright (E2E)
  Conventions: Functional components, hooks-first, CSS Modules or Tailwind
  Code Quality: Biome for linting/formatting

rules:
  language:
{{#if (isLanguage "zh")}}
    - "所有文档、规格、提案、设计和任务必须使用简体中文编写"
    - "所有代码注释必须使用简体中文编写"
    - "所有 commit message 必须使用简体中文编写"
    - "所有 PR 描述和代码审查评论必须使用简体中文编写"
{{else}}
    - "All documents, specs, proposals, designs, and tasks MUST be written in English"
    - "All code comments MUST be written in English"
    - "All commit messages MUST be written in English"
    - "All PR descriptions and review comments MUST be written in English"
{{/if}}
  coding:
{{#if (isLanguage "zh")}}
    - "所有新编写的函数/组件必须包含完整的 JSDoc 注释，包括：功能描述、@param（每个参数的类型和含义）、@returns（返回值类型和含义）"
    - "所有新编写的类（class）必须包含完整的 JSDoc 类注释，包括：类的职责说明、使用场景"
    - "所有新编写的 TypeScript 接口（interface）和类型（type）必须包含注释，说明其用途和每个字段的含义"
    - "React 组件必须使用 JSDoc 或 TSDoc 注释说明组件的功能、Props 含义和使用示例"
    - "禁止提交没有注释的导出（export）函数、类和组件"
{{else}}
    - "Every newly written function/component MUST include complete JSDoc comments covering: purpose, @param (type and meaning of each parameter), @returns (return type and meaning)"
    - "Every newly written class MUST include complete JSDoc class comments covering: class responsibility and usage scenarios"
    - "Every newly written TypeScript interface and type MUST include comments explaining its purpose and the meaning of each field"
    - "React components MUST use JSDoc or TSDoc comments describing the component purpose, Props meaning, and usage examples"
    - "Exported functions, classes, and components without comments MUST NOT be committed"
{{/if}}
  proposal:
    - "Must include UI/UX impact analysis"
    - "Must specify browser/device compatibility requirements"
  specs:
    - "Use Given/When/Then format for user interaction scenarios"
  ui_components:
    - "UI 组件库优先使用 hammer 与 @hammer/* 生态（以及现有项目中的封装组件，例如 @hammer/basic、@hammer/pro 等）；不要私自引入新的 UI 库来实现同类基础组件"
    - "非常重要：按 package.json 中 hammer / @hammer/* 的 version 选择文档站"
    - "含 qa → https://hammer.yzwqa.cn；含 stg → https://hammer-stg.yzw.cn；否则 https://hammer.yzw.cn"
    - "qa 与 stg 同时出现时用 qa"
  design:
    - "Must include component tree diagram or description"
    - "Must specify route design and state management strategy"
